{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNlzheggEhKyUjlKS0RR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for design context on the components and media pages so I can reuse them properly. I open the Components page (1:3) for the Button (1:22) and Text Field (1:25) structures, then the Media page (1:4) for the symbol nodes: Logo_Mark 3:16, social logos 3:14/3:15/3:17, avatars 3:18/3:19, photos 3:20-3:35, icons 3:3-3:13. I run one read query dumping each node's type, size, fills, radii, auto-layout and image hashes, and check that DM Sans is available. Since the symbols sit in the same file, I treat them as components reachable by node ID, and I request screenshots of 1:3 and 1:4 to see the visuals.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":13422,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":10758,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13422}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a2ea8f9-759f-405f-98a5-13324c4c09fc","uuid":"f75deff8-b51b-476f-8a9a-7fb787008910","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:29:27.204Z","thinking_duration_ms":20357}
