s, price $450,000 with a \"$280/sq ft\" pill; gallery with a main photo plus 7 thumbnails, none selected, counter \"1 / 8\"; then a two-column body — left holds the description split into 3 paragraphs at sentence boundaries without rewording, the details strip (4 Bedrooms, 2 Bathrooms, 2 Garage, 1 Floor, Built 2007), and 15 features with Icon_Check in 3 columns; right holds the agent card with the prefilled message \"Hello, I am interested in…\", Email shown focused with an amber 2 px ring, and other fields default; then similar listings 4-up at 280 wide with Icon_Chevron_Left/Right circular buttons; footer.\n\nComponent sheet: Button set (Default/Hover/Disabled), Text Field set (Default/Focused/Filled/Error), Header, Footer, Listing Card, Testimonial item, Filter field, Feature item. Every button and field in both screens uses these instances, and I place one instance each of 1:22 and 1:25 beside my library labelled as from `02 · Components`.\n\nPrototype: \"See all listings\" and every listing card go to `02_Property`; similar cards link to `02_Property` itself; logos return to `01_Home`.\n\nTwo unknowns remain: whether icon components recolor cleanly, and which photo is which, so I probe icon children and retry the media screenshot inline with `enableBase64Response: true` at maxDimension 600 before building.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":10353,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":24180,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10353}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a2ea8f9-759f-405f-98a5-13324c4c09fc","uuid":"712135dd-3995-426e-a012-4b9c9c2f4c48","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:32:56.649Z","thinking_duration_ms":68205}
