{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNmTexAnE2t8uxC26wn4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The task is to define the shared styles and build the independent components — header, footer, nav, listing card, testimonial item, filter field, feature item, detail item, contact card — all in one call, plus a screenshot of the design system result from the previous response, since the screenshot needs no output from this build.\n\nFor styles, I create text styles for H1 through caption and paint styles for the core colors, starting from the darkest heading and running down to the caption size.\n\nFor the header component I set the frame to 1440 wide and 88 tall, white with a bottom border. The inner content sits at 1216 centered: the logo group pairs a Logo_Mark instance (11x33) with \"NORTHGATE\" at 20 Bold, letterSpacing 6 percent. The nav holds Buy/Sell/Rent/About at 16 Medium with gap 40, then a spacer, then a Primary Default button instance labeled \"Work with us\". No hamburger. No problem with creating the variant instance: bset.children.find(c => c.name === 'Style=Primary, State=Default').createInstance().\n\nThe footer is 1440 wide, dark #14161B: the headline \"Make your dreams a reality\" at 40 Bold white plus a Work with us button, then the logo and NORTHGATE in white-ish, and three columns Company/Services/Resources, with a bottom bar holding the copyright and social logos. Social logos are Logo_Facebook vectors recolored white so the shape stays unaltered.\n\nFilter Field: 232 wide, border 1.5 line, radius 4, padding 16, with the label \"Looking for\" at 12 Medium muted and a value row of 16 ink text plus a chevron down instance. The bar itself combines four fields (Looking for, Location, Property Type, Price) with a Search button.\n\nListing Card is 384 wide with vertical auto layout and clip: a photo wrapper 384x248 filling the width over a body with padding 24 and gap 10 holding the name at 20 SemiBold ink and a meta row of bed/bath/area icons at 14 muted with gap 24. The photo instance resizes to 384x240 and gets layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL', so resizing the instance to 280 for the Property page works. Hover states get a shadow across the 12 variants.\n\nTestimonial Item: avatar 72, name 16 SemiBold, \"Client\" 14 muted. Feature Item: a 24x24 amber-tint circle with a 12x12 check recolored ink, plus a 16 label. Detail Item: icon 24 recolored ink, value 20 SemiBold, label 14 muted.\n\nContact card: 384 wide, vertical, padding 28, radius 12, white with a border: avatar 72, name, a View profile link, Name/Phone/Email fields at 328 wide with Email focused, a message textarea filled \"Hello, I am interested in…\", and a Contact agent button. Putting the field input frame at FILL lets the instance width propagate.\n\nThumbnail: 160x112 clipped radius 8 with a border, variants Default/Selected.\n\nI position the design system at (0,0) and the page components frame at 1440 wide beneath it. The second build call writes styles and the header/footer plus all these components, and runs alongside the screenshot request since nothing in it consumes the screenshot's result.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":11338,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":42871,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11338}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a2ea8f9-759f-405f-98a5-13324c4c09fc","uuid":"39f5ae7e-d9e7-41fb-9efc-347b47e93050","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:36:11.420Z","thinking_duration_ms":59529}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNmTexAnE2t8uxC26wn4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Components for buttons and fields are built. Next I'm adding the page-level components (header, footer, nav link), the business components (listing card with photo variants, filter field, testimonial item, feature item, detail item, gallery thumbnail, agent contact card), and the shared paint/text styles."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":11338,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":42871,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11338}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a2ea8f9-759f-405f-98a5-13324c4c09fc","uuid":"65f80c5a-5cf2-4e4b-bc8b-4064a5bf7887","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:36:12.948Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNmTexAnE2t8uxC26wn4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01vAwMBejZBU2sHnvzhSE8a2","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.startsWith('03'));\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of ['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold','ExtraBold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'DM Sans', style:s});\nconst C = h=>({r:parseInt(h.slice(1,3),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(3,5),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(5,7),16)/255});\nconst K = {ink:C('#14161B'), body:C('#4B5058'), muted:C('#8A8F98'), line:C('#E7E6E1'), soft:C('#F6F5F2'), white:C('#FFFFFF'), amber:C('#FFAC12'), amberHover:C('#F0A000'), amberTint:C('#FFF3DA'), error:C('#C5341B'), onDark:C('#B9BDC4'), darkLine:C('#2A2D33'), dark:C('#14161B')};\nconst solid = c=>[{type:'SOLID', color:c}];\nfunction mkStyle(name,color){ try{const s=figma.createPaintStyle(); s.name=name; s.paints=solid(color); return s;}catch(e){return null;} }\n[['Northgate/Ink',K.ink],['Northgate/Body',K.body],['Northgate/Muted',K.muted],['Northgate/Line',K.line],['Northgate/Surface soft',K.soft],['Northgate/Amber',K.amber],['Northgate/Amber tint',K.amberTint],['Northgate/Dark',K.dark],['Northgate/Error',K.error]].forEach(([n,c])=>mkStyle(n,c));\nfunction tStyle(name,size,style,lh,ls,tracking){ try{const s=figma.createTextStyle(); s.name=name; s.fontName={family:'DM Sans',style}; s.fontSize=size; s.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:lh}; s.letterSpacing={unit:'PERCENT',value:ls||0}; return s;}catch(e){return null;} }\ntStyle('Northgate/Display',64,'Bold',68,-2);\ntStyle('Northgate/H1',48,'Bold',54,-1.5);\ntStyle('Northgate/H2',40,'Bold',46,-1);\ntStyle('Northgate/H3',28,'Bold',34,-0.5);\ntStyle('Northgate/H4',20,'SemiBold',26,0);\ntStyle('Northgate/Body',16,'Regular',26,0);\ntStyle('Northgate/Body strong',16,'Medium',24,0);\ntStyle('Northgate/Small',14,'Regular',22,0);\ntStyle('Northgate/Caption',12,'Medium',16,4);\nfunction T(chars,size,style,color,o={}){\n  const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName={family:'DM Sans',style}; t.characters=chars; t.fontSize=size;\n  t.fills=solid(color); t.lineHeight = o.lh?{unit:'PIXELS',value:o.lh}:{unit:'AUTO'};\n  t.letterSpacing={unit:'PERCENT',value:o.ls!==undefined?o.ls:0};\n  if(o.align) t.textAlignHorizontal=o.align;\n  if(o.w){ t.resize(o.w, Math.max(t.height,10)); t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; }\n  if(o.name) t.name=o.name;\n  return t;\n}\nfunction FR(name,w,h,fill,o={}){\n  const f=figma.createFrame(); f.name=name; f.fills=fill?solid(fill):[]; f.resize(w,h);\n  if(o.r!==undefined) f.cornerRadius=o.r;\n  if(o.stroke){ f.strokes=solid(o.stroke); f.strokeWeight=o.sw||1; }\n  if(o.mode){ f.layoutMode=o.mode; f.primaryAxisSizingMode=o.prim||'FIXED'; f.counterAxisSizingMode=o.cnt||'FIXED'; f.itemSpacing=o.gap||0;\n    f.paddingTop=o.pt||0; f.paddingBottom=o.pb||0; f.paddingLeft=o.pl||0; f.paddingRight=o.pr||0;\n    if(o.align) f.primaryAxisAlignItems=o.align; if(o.cal) f.counterAxisAlignItems=o.cal; }\n  if(o.clip!==undefined) f.clipsContent=o.clip;\n  return f;\n}\nfunction icon(id,color){ const inst=figma.getNodeById(id).createInstance();\n  inst.findAll(n=>['VECTOR','RECTANGLE','ELLIPSE','LINE','POLYGON','STAR','BOOLEAN_OPERATION'].includes(n.type)).forEach(v=>{\n    try{ if(v.fills && v.fills.length) v.fills=solid(color);}catch(e){}\n    try{ if(v.strokes && v.strokes.length) v.strokes=solid(color);}catch(e){} });\n  return inst; }\nconst btnSet = figma.getNodeById('8:42');\nconst fieldSet = figma.getNodeById('8:63');\nconst btn=(style,state)=>{const c=btnSet.children.find(x=>x.name===`Style=${style}, State=${state}`); return c.createInstance();};\nconst field=(state)=>{const c=fieldSet.children.find(x=>x.name===`State=${state}`); const i=c.createInstance(); return i;};\n// make field internals fill width\nfieldSet.children.forEach(c=>{ c.layoutSizingHorizontal='FIXED'; const box=c.children[1]; try{box.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';}catch(e){} });\n\nconst ds2 = FR('Northgate · Page Components', 1440, 100, C('#FBFAF8'), {mode:'VERTICAL', prim:'AUTO', pt:64, pb:64, gap:64});\npage.appendChild(ds2);\nfunction section(name){ const s=FR(name,1440,10,null,{mode:'VERTICAL',prim:'AUTO',gap:32,pl:112,pr:112}); ds2.appendChild(s); return s; }\n\n/* ---------- Header ---------- */\nconst secHeader = section('Header');\nconst header = figma.createComponent(); header.name='Header'; header.resize(1440,88);\nheader.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; header.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; header.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\nheader.paddingLeft=112; header.paddingRight=112; header.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; header.itemSpacing=48;\nheader.fills=solid(K.white); header.strokes=solid(K.line); header.strokeWeight=1;\nconst logoG = FR('Logo',10,40,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:10,cal:'CENTER'});\nlogoG.appendChild(icon('3:16',K.ink));\nlogoG.appendChild(T('NORTHGATE',20,'Bold',K.ink,{lh:24,ls:8}));\nheader.appendChild(logoG);\nconst nav = FR('Navigation',10,24,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:40,cal:'CENTER'});\n['Buy','Sell','Rent','About'].forEach(x=>nav.appendChild(T(x,16,'Medium',K.ink,{lh:24})));\nheader.appendChild(nav);\nconst sp = FR('Spacer',10,10,null,{}); sp.layoutGrow=1; header.appendChild(sp);\nheader.appendChild(btn('Primary','Default'));\nsecHeader.appendChild(header);\n\n/* ---------- Nav link ---------- */\nconst secNav = section('Navigation links');\nconst navRow = FR('Row',1216,10,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:40});\nconst navVars=[];\nfor(const st of ['Default','Hover']){\n  const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name='State='+st; c.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\n  c.itemSpacing=4; c.paddingBottom=6; c.fills=[]; c.strokes= st==='Hover'? solid(K.ink):[];\n  c.strokeWeight=2; c.strokeAlign='INSIDE';\n  c.appendChild(T('Nav item',16,'Medium',K.ink,{lh:24}));\n  navRow.appendChild(c); navVars.push(c);\n}\nconst navSet=figma.combineAsVariants(navVars,navRow); navSet.name='Nav Link';\nsecNav.appendChild(navRow);\n\n/* ---------- Footer ---------- */\nconst secFooter = section('Footer');\nconst footer = figma.createComponent(); footer.name='Footer'; footer.resize(1440,560);\nfooter.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; footer.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; footer.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\nfooter.fills=solid(K.dark); footer.paddingTop=88; footer.paddingBottom=56; footer.paddingLeft=112; footer.paddingRight=112; footer.itemSpacing=0;\nfooter.counterAxisAlignItems='MIN';\nconst fTop = FR('CTA row',1216,10,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'FIXED',cnt:'AUTO',gap:48,cal:'CENTER'});\nfTop.primaryAxisAlignItems='SPACE_BETWEEN';\nconst fHead = T('Make your dreams a reality',40,'Bold',K.white,{lh:48,ls:-1,w:620});\nfTop.appendChild(fHead);\nfTop.appendChild(btn('Primary','Default'));\nfooter.appendChild(fTop);\nfooter.appendChild((()=>{const d=FR('Divider',1216,1,C('#2A2D33'),{}); return d;})()).layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\nconst fDiv = footer.children[footer.children.length-1];\nfDiv.name='Divider'; // spacing handled below\nconst fMid = FR('Columns',1216,10,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'FIXED',cnt:'AUTO',gap:80});\nconst brandCol = FR('Brand',380,10,null,{mode:'VERTICAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'FIXED',gap:24});\nconst flogo = FR('Logo',10,40,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:10,cal:'CENTER'});\nflogo.appendChild(icon('3:16',K.ink));\nflogo.appendChild(T('NORTHGATE',20,'Bold',K.white,{lh:24,ls:8}));\nbrandCol.appendChild(flogo);\nconst socialRow = FR('Social',10,22,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:20,cal:'CENTER'});\n[['3:14',20],['3:17',18],['3:15',22]].forEach(([id,h])=>socialRow.appendChild(icon(id,C('#B9BDC4'))));\nbrandCol.appendChild(socialRow);\nfMid.appendChild(brandCol);\nconst fcols=[['Company',['About us','Our agents','Careers','Contact']],['Services',['Buy a home','Sell a home','Rent a home','Property management']],['Resources',['Market reports','Buyer guide','Seller guide','FAQ']]];\nfcols.forEach(([title,links])=>{\n  const col=FR(title,220,10,null,{mode:'VERTICAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'FIXED',gap:12});\n  col.appendChild(T(title,14,'Bold',K.white,{lh:20,ls:6}));\n  links.forEach(l=>col.appendChild(T(l,16,'Regular',K.onDark,{lh:24})));\n  fMid.appendChild(col);\n});\nfooter.appendChild(fMid);\nsecFooter.appendChild(footer);\nconst fSpacer=FR('Footer spacing',10,10,null,{}); fSpacer.visible=false;\n// set vertical spacing via explicit gaps: use padding on rows\nfTop.paddingBottom=56; fDiv.paddingBottom=0; fMid.paddingTop=56;\n\n/* ---------- Listing Card ---------- */\nconst secCard = section('Listing cards');\nconst cardRows=FR('Rows',1216,10,null,{mode:'VERTICAL',prim:'AUTO',gap:40}); secCard.appendChild(cardRows);\nconst cardsByPhoto={};\nfor(let p=1;p<=6;p++){\n  const row=FR('Photo '+p,1216,10,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:32}); cardRows.appendChild(row);\n  const vars=[];\n  for(const st of ['Default','Hover']){\n    const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name=`Photo=${p}, State=${st}`;\n    c.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\n    c.resize(384,400); c.cornerRadius=12; c.fills=solid(K.white); c.clipsContent=true;\n    c.strokes=solid(st==='Hover'?C('#DCD9D2'):K.line); c.strokeWeight=1;\n    if(st==='Hover') c.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.08,g:0.09,b:0.11,a:0.14},offset:{x:0,y:12},radius:28,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\n    const photo=figma.getNodeById('3:22'+''.padEnd(0,'')); // placeholder\n    const src=figma.getNodeById(['3:22','3:23','3:24','3:25','3:26','3:34'][p-1]);\n    const pi=src.createInstance(); pi.resize(384,248); pi.name='Photo';\n    const pf=FR('Photo wrap',384,248,null,{clip:true}); pf.appendChild(pi); pi.x=0; pi.y=0;\n    c.appendChild(pf); pf.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n    const body=FR('Body',384,10,null,{mode:'VERTICAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:12,pt:20,pb:24,pl:24,pr:24});\n    body.appendChild(T('Listing name',20,'SemiBold',K.ink,{lh:26}));\n    const meta=FR('Meta',10,20,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:20,cal:'CENTER'});\n    [['3:6',14,11,'4 bd'],['3:5',16,16,'2 ba'],['3:4',16,16,'1,650 sq ft']].forEach(([id,w,h,val])=>{\n      const g=FR('Meta item',10,20,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:8,cal:'CENTER'});\n      g.appendChild(icon(id,K.ink));\n      g.appendChild(T(val,14,'Medium',K.body,{lh:20}));\n      meta.appendChild(g);\n    });\n    body.appendChild(meta);\n    c.appendChild(body); body.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n    row.appendChild(c); vars.push(c);\n  }\n  const set=figma.combineAsVariants(vars,row); set.name='Listing Card · Photo '+p;\n  cardsByPhoto[p]=set;\n}\n/* ---------- Filter field ---------- */\nconst secFilter = section('Search filters');\nconst filtRow=FR('Row',1216,10,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:16}); secFilter.appendChild(filtRow);\nconst fVars=[];\nfor(const st of ['Default','Open']){\n  const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name='State='+st; c.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\n  c.resize(232,72); c.paddingTop=14; c.paddingBottom=14; c.paddingLeft=16; c.paddingRight=16; c.itemSpacing=4;\n  c.cornerRadius=4; c.fills=solid(st==='Open'?K.white:C('#FBFAF8')); c.strokes=solid(st==='Open'?K.ink:K.line); c.strokeWeight=st==='Open'?2:1;\n  c.appendChild(T('Looking for',12,'Medium',K.muted,{lh:16,ls:4}));\n  const vr=FR('Value row',10,24,null,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'FIXED',cnt:'AUTO',cal:'CENTER'}); vr.primaryAxisAlignItems='SPACE_BETWEEN';\n  vr.appendChild(T('Any',16,'SemiBold',K.ink,{lh:24}));\n  vr.appendChild(icon('3:9',K.ink));\n  c.appendChild(vr); vr.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n  filtRow.appendChild(c); fVars.push(c);\n}\nconst fset=figma.combineAsVariants(fVars,filtRow); fset.name='Filter Field';\n\n/* ---------- Testimonial item ---------- */\nconst secTest = s