{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNmmsIpDmXvnpzqAHYzn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to verify the design visually and build the Home frame. All components exist, so the screenshot of ds2, header and footer and the 01_Home build both run independently. I place Home at x=2400 with width 1440 and height auto, a vertical auto-layout frame. The hero section has 112 side padding, 96 top and bottom, a 560-wide text column and Photo_Hero_House at 592x480 with radius 24; the Primary instance label overrides to \"See all listings\". Agency intro 1 pairs a 480x360 photo with the \"You're in good hands\" copy; intro 2 reverses to \"Local experts on every street\". The CTA band uses #14161B, radius 24, \"Ready to sell your home?\" at 40 Bold. Listings run 6 cards in 3 columns of 384 with 32 gaps: 112+1152+64+112 = 1440. Four filter fields at 232 wide plus 16 gaps plus a Search button total 1116 inside 1216. The testimonial sets Current=Yes on Leo Madrigal. Building 02_Property comes after, since both append frames to the same page and I avoid concurrency on one file.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":10913,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":71154,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10913}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a2ea8f9-759f-405f-98a5-13324c4c09fc","uuid":"8f6edded-e777-4057-82a0-902cbb16fa3b","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:39:25.053Z","thinking_duration_ms":17862}
