{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNmrWenJztJFbLSRhkpN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a high-detail look at the Home screenshot, a look at the component sheet screenshot, and a build of 02_Property. The Home build returned, and the component screenshot is 679x1800 at scale. The Property build depends only on component IDs I already have, not on the Home screenshots, so the two screenshot requests and the 02_Property build run as independent steps.\n\nFor 02_Property I set the header, then a title bar with eyebrow \"FOR SALE\", H1 \"Modern House\" at 56 Bold, the address, and on the right the price \"$450,000\" at 40 Bold with a \"$280/sq ft\" pill. The gallery holds a main photo of 1216x600 with a counter chip and 7 thumbnails of 160 each plus 16 gaps: 7*160+6*16=1216. The body splits into 776 and 384 with a 56 gap, giving 1216: description in 3 paragraphs, a details strip of 5 items with dividers on soft bg at radius 16, and 15 features in 3 columns of 5.\n\nThe agent card instance (10:415) takes Name, Phone, and Email, with Email focused at \"alex.morgan@email.com\". I turn Detail Item (10:402) into a component set with 5 variants: Bedrooms \"4\", Bathrooms \"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":7241,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":82067,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7241}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a2ea8f9-759f-405f-98a5-13324c4c09fc","uuid":"c55f9ce4-a601-4a9f-a3ec-741fa08f67aa","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:40:25.727Z","thinking_duration_ms":22138}
