{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNn2Lddrd1HT7gHUxetK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to plan fixes for the Figma build. I first check why `page.findOne(n => n.name === 'Detail Item Set')` returned null: the earlier Property call threw at the arrows line, and plugin changes are transactional per call, so that whole run reverted. The detail variants were never created, and the second Property call also reverted, so no partial '02_Property' frame exists.\n\nNext I look at the Home screenshot. The hero headline, copy and button overlap; \"You're in good hands\" and \"Ready to sell your home?\" overlap their copy; the testimonial quote spills onto the clients row. In vertical containers I set `cnt:'FIXED'`, but counter axis is width there, so that is correct and is not the cause. The probable cause is in T(): I set `textAutoResize='HEIGHT'` and then call `resize(w, 10)`, which seems to leave height at 10 so lines overflow. I change the order: set `textAutoResize='HEIGHT'` then `resize(o.w, 20)`, letting height fit the wrapped lines.\n\nI then delete any existing 01_Home (11:131) and 02_Property frames, create the detail set variants inside the 'Detail item' section, and rebuild both frames with the corrected helper, keeping the numbers: hero padding 88+96, text width 560, photo 592x480, gap 64.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":8674,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":97680,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8674}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a2ea8f9-759f-405f-98a5-13324c4c09fc","uuid":"8e131d4d-dde5-4f28-ade2-c60908efac99","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:42:53.772Z","thinking_duration_ms":37539}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNn2Lddrd1HT7gHUxetK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two failures to fix before anything else: the Property build rolled back completely (the \"Detail Item Set\" it referenced was never created, since Figma reverts a plugin run on error), and the Home render shows text frames overflowing their bounds — the multiline copy and the testimonial quote overlap neighbouring blocks because of how I sized text (resize before autosize settled). Next private list:\n\n1. Rebuild text helper with reliable auto-height, then rebuild `01_Home`.\n2. Create the Detail Item variant set, then build `02_Property`.\n3. Screenshot both, then wire the prototype links.\n\nItems 1 and 2 are sequential within one script on the same page; item 3 depends on both existing. So this response is one build call (detail set + Property first, since Home already exists and only needs a repair pass), and then I verify.\n\nI'm now rebuilding both screens with the corrected text sizing."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":8674,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":97680,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8674}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a2ea8f9-759f-405f-98a5-13324c4c09fc","uuid":"e86ad361-ea93-4b69-b59e-ae934d0b0f67","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:43:00.167Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNn2Lddrd1HT7gHUxetK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01dKg9qUnkxvRm8fY6AzYNKz","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.startsWith('03'));\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of ['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'DM Sans', style:s});\nconst C = h=>({r:parseInt(h.slice(1,3),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(3,5),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(5,7),16)/255});\nconst K = {ink:C('#14161B'), body:C('#4B5058'), muted:C('#8A8F98'), line:C('#E7E6E1'), soft:C('#F6F5F2'), white:C('#FFFFFF'), amber:C('#FFAC12'), onDark:C('#B9BDC4')};\nconst solid = c=>[{type:'SOLID', color:c}];\nfunction T(chars,size,style,color,o={}){\n  const t=figma.createText();\n  t.fontName={family:'DM Sans',style};\n  t.fontSize=size;\n  t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';\n  t.characters=chars;\n  t.lineHeight=o.lh?{unit:'PIXELS',value:o.lh}:{unit:'AUTO'};\n  t.letterSpacing={unit:'PERCENT',value:o.ls!==undefined?o.ls:0};\n  t.fills=solid(color);\n  if(o.w){ t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; t.resize(o.w, t.height); }\n  if(o.name) t.name=o.name;\n  return t;\n}\nfunction FR(name,w,h,fill,o={}){ const f=figma.createFrame(); f.name=name; f.fills=fill?solid(fill):[]; f.resize(w,h);\n  if(o.r!==undefined) f.cornerRadius=o.r; if(o.stroke){f.strokes=solid(o.stroke); f.strokeWeight=o.sw||1;}\n  if(o.mode){ f.layoutMode=o.mode; f.primaryAxisSizingMode=o.prim||'FIXED'; f.counterAxisSizingMode=o.cnt||'FIXED'; f.itemSpacing=o.gap||0;\n    f.paddingTop=o.pt||0; f.paddingBottom=o.pb||0; f.paddingLeft=o.pl||0; f.paddingRight=o.pr||0; if(o.align)f.primaryAxisAlignItems=o.align; if(o.cal)f.counterAxisAlignItems=o.cal; }\n  if(o.clip!==undefined) f.clipsContent=o.clip; return f; }\nfunction add(p,n){ p.appendChild(n); return n; }\nfunction icon(id,color){ const inst=figma.getNodeById(id).createInstance();\n  inst.findAll(n=>['VECTOR','RECTANGLE','ELLIPSE','LINE','POLYGON','STAR','BOOLEAN_OPERATION'].includes(n.type)).forEach(v=>{\n    try{ if(v.fills&&v.fills.length) v.fills=solid(color);}catch(e){}\n    try{ if(v.strokes&&v.strokes.length) v.strokes=solid(color);}catch(e){} }); return inst; }\nconst btnSet=figma.getNodeById('8:42'), linkSet=figma.getNodeById('10:51');\nfunction btn(style,state,label){ const i=btnSet.children.find(x=>x.name===`Style=${style}, State=${state}`).createInstance();\n  if(label){ const t=i.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'); if(t)t.characters=label; } return i; }\nfunction lnk(tone,label){ const i=linkSet.children.find(x=>x.name===`Tone=${tone}, State=Default`).createInstance();\n  const t=i.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'); if(t)t.characters=label; return i; }\n\n/* clean previous screens */\npage.children.filter(n=>n.name==='01_Home'||n.name==='02_Property').forEach(n=>n.remove());\n\n/* Detail Item variants */\nlet dset = page.findOne(n=>n.name==='Detail Item Set');\nif(!dset){\n  const base=figma.getNodeById('10:402');\n  const par=base.parent;\n  const mk=(type,ic,val,label)=>{ const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name='Type='+type; c.layoutMode='VERTICAL';\n    c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; c.resize(120,110); c.itemSpacing=10; c.fills=[];\n    add(c, icon(ic,K.ink));\n    add(c, T(val,20,'Bold',K.ink,{lh:26}));\n    add(c, T(label,14,'Medium',K.muted,{lh:20}));\n    return c; };\n  base.name='Type=Bedrooms';\n  const arr=[base, mk('Bathrooms','3:5','2','Bathrooms'), mk('Garage','3:13','2','Garage'), mk('Floor','3:12','1','Floor'), mk('Built','3:7','2007','Built')];\n  dset=figma.combineAsVariants(arr, par); dset.name='Detail Item Set';\n}\nconst detail=tp=>dset.children.find(c=>c.name==='Type='+tp).createInstance();\n\n/* ===================== 01_Home ===================== */\nconst home=FR('01_Home',1440,100,K.white,{mode:'VERTICAL',prim:'AUTO',gap:0}); home.x=1600; home.y=0; page.appendChild(home);\nconst h1=figma.getNodeById('10:13').createInstance(); add(home,h1); h1.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n\nconst hero=FR('Hero',1440,10,K.white,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:64,pt:80,pb:88,pl:112,pr:112});\nhero.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nconst heroL=FR('Hero text',560,10,null,{mode:'VERTICAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'FIXED',gap:28});\nadd(heroL, T('Beautiful homes\\nmade for you',64,'Bold',K.ink,{lh:70,ls:-2,w:560}));\nadd(heroL, T('Hand-picked homes, honest advice and a team that knows every street in the neighbourhoods we serve.',18,'Regular',K.body,{lh:30,w:470}));\nadd(heroL, btn('Primary','Default','See all listings'));\nadd(hero,heroL);\nconst heroPhoto=FR('Hero photo',592,480,null,{r:24,clip:true});\nconst hp=figma.getNodeById('3:21').createInstance(); hp.resize(592,480); add(heroPhoto,hp); hp.x=0; hp.y=0;\nadd(hero,heroPhoto);\nadd(home,hero); hero.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n\nfunction agency(title, copy, reverse){\n  const s=FR('Agency · '+title,1440,10,K.white,{mode:'HORIZONTAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'AUTO',gap:80,pt:56,pb:56,pl:112,pr:112});\n  s.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  const pw=FR('Photo',520,380,null,{r:16,clip:true});\n  const pi=figma.getNodeById('3:20').createInstance(); pi.resize(520,380); add(pw,pi); pi.x=0;pi.y=0;\n  const txt=FR('Text',616,10,null,{mode:'VERTICAL',prim:'AUTO',cnt:'FIXED',gap:20});\n  add(txt, T('ABOUT NORTHGATE',12,'Bold',K.muted,{lh:16,ls:12}));\n  add(txt, T(title,44,'Bold',K.ink,{lh:52,ls:-1.2,w:560}));\n  add(txt, T(copy,17,'Regular',K.body,{lh:30,w:520}));\n  add(txt, lnk('Light','Learn more'));\n  if(reverse){ add(s,txt); add(s,pw); } else { add(s,pw); add(s,txt); }\n  return s;\n}\nadd(home, agency('You’re in good hands','Our agents have helped more than 2,000 families buy, sell and rent. We listen first, explain every step and stay with you until the keys are in your hand.',false));\nadd(home, agency('Local experts on every street','We live where we work. From school catchments to the quietest blocks, we can te